OL,3,A'I have to be up for work soon...':
OL,4,AGamers stay up for GTA 6 after midnight
OL,5,Arelease
OL,6,
OL,7,FGrand Theft Auto 6 has been released
OL,8,Faround the world, ending the 13-year
OL,9,Fwait for a new instalment of the game
OL,11,FIn the UK, some gamers found it hard to
OL,12,Fgo to bed after the long-awaited
OL,13,Fmidnight release
OL,15,F"I have to be up for work in five
OL,16,Fhours," one gamer told us overnight.
OL,17,F"Why am I playing a game I have years
OL,18,Fto enjoy?"
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
