OL,3,AMyanmar faces historic genocide verdict
OL,4,Aat UN court over Rohingya massacres
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen the judges of the International
OL,7,FCourt of Justice read out their verdict
OL,8,Fin the seven-year-old genocide case
OL,9,Ffiled by The Gambia against Myanmar on
OL,10,FThursday, they could make history.
OL,12,FIn the years since the Genocide
OL,13,FConvention was signed in 1948, after
OL,14,Fthe Nazi Holocaust, dozens of
OL,15,Findividuals have been successfully
OL,16,Fprosecuted for the crime of genocide,
OL,17,Fin conflicts such as those in Rwanda
OL,18,Fand the former Yugoslavia.
OL,20,FBut no state has ever been found guilty
OL,21,Fby an international court of committing
OL,22,Fgenocide.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
