OL,3,AAnthropic valued at $1.5 trillion ahead
OL,4,Aof AI giant's stock market debut
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt will also mark a crucial test for
OL,7,Fthe fast-growing industry, which faces
OL,8,Fquestions over whether the huge amounts
OL,9,Fof money being poured into the
OL,10,Ftechnology will pay off.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
